\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Small-Business Cybersecurity Risk Assessment\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf0 Project Overview\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 This project presents a simulated cybersecurity risk assessment for Moonlit Market, a fictional small online retail business.\
The goal is to identify potential cybersecurity risks, evaluate their likelihood and business impact, prioritize remediation activities, and recommend practical security controls.\
This project demonstrates foundational skills in cybersecurity risk management, governance, risk, and compliance (GRC), and business-focused security analysis.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Business Scenario\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Moonlit Market is a fictional online boutique with eight employees. Its business operations depend on an online storefront, cloud-based email, employee accounts, and digital business records.\
For this assessment, I assumed that some security practices were inconsistent or undocumented, including multifactor authentication coverage, access reviews, and backup restoration testing.\
These are simulated assumptions, not findings from a real organization.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

