\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Key Findings\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The simulated assessment identified five example risks:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Compromised employee accounts due to inconsistent MFA.\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Ransomware disrupting business operations.\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Excessive access permissions exposing customer information.\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Backup restoration failures causing prolonged downtime.\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Phishing leading to credential theft or fraudulent activity.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\
R-01: Risk score : 20 (Critical)\
R-02: Risk score: 15 (High)\
R-03: Risk score: 12 (High)\
R-04: Risk score: 15 (High)\
R-05: Risk score: 16 (High)\
\
The risk with the highest score was compromised employee accounts with the consistency of MFA being the common denominator. I propose a mandatory enforcement of MFA in order to protect accounts from unauthorized access in order for the company to continue with disrupted operations and business integrity. \
The remaining risks were also on the high end of the risk scale. These issues will need to be promptly addressed through the IT team along with operations and business owner interference.\
\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

