\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Limitations\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 This is an educational, hypothetical assessment. No real business systems were accessed, no penetration testing was performed, and no security controls were independently verified.\
The results should not be interpreted as a formal audit, certification, or guarantee of security.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

